{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950260/extras/4b88c9f54ee86cd21587c557582622a0.avif?t=1756305117\" width=1280 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this unique single-player deck-building adventure game, you will delve into the underground world of a mysterious desert, build your own deck, fight lurking monsters, and unearth lost treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Build powerful card combinations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950260/extras/d5610e8505d2e49c9dbc790ac7437808.avif?t=1756305117\" width=634 height=228 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Encountering unknown creatures</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950260/extras/3c86a1dd5c629d6eb84d046acde38583.avif?t=1756305117\" width=634 height=250 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dangerous caves</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950260/extras/f71ba21cc119ff8f0c6b7043d7a7b319.avif?t=1756305117\" width=634 height=250 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">The prosperity of the settlement</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950260/extras/198578f55217df3702e47bdab3a8d17b.avif?t=1756305117\" width=634 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every fork in the road is a fateful choice, and every drip of water could be the countdown to a trap. Bring your torch and courage. The most precious thing in the darkness is never gold, but the unwritten stories\u2014and your legend begins at the next corner.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3950260?t=1756305117","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3950260?t=1756305117","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950260/708efc14df0d2410fbbc910ce781207a16146265/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756305117","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950260/708efc14df0d2410fbbc910ce781207a16146265/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756305117","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3951860,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950260/extras/4b88c9f54ee86cd21587c557582622a0.avif?t=1756305117\" width=1280 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this unique single-player deck-building adventure game, you will delve into the underground world of a mysterious desert, build your own deck, fight lurking monsters, and unearth lost treasures.